OL,6,Cas new Bond                            
OL,7,GJeff Bezos has said he was "heavily    
OL,8,Ginvolved" in casting Robert Pattinson  
OL,9,Gas the new James Bond.                 
OL,11,FSpeaking at an event in California,    
OL,12,Fthe Amazon chairman said he was        
OL,13,Foriginally "biased against" Pattinson  
OL,14,F- who starred in many blockbuster      
OL,15,Ffilms like Batman and the Twilight     
OL,16,Fseries - "because he's already so      
OL,17,Ffamous".                               
